WEBVTT

00:00:07.520 --> 00:00:11.320
"Hashiba-kun, are you feeling better now?"

00:00:12.640 --> 00:00:14.810
That's what I wrote in my text.

00:00:15.630 --> 00:00:18.990
But the truth is, I wanted
to ask one more thing...

00:01:54.020 --> 00:01:55.090
Oh?

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:57.800
So, the little monkey passed out...

00:02:00.260 --> 00:02:02.510
Then the creepy jerk and pal carried him away?

00:02:03.810 --> 00:02:04.680
Yeah.

00:02:05.620 --> 00:02:09.390
I was so relieved that
those two were there to help.

00:02:09.390 --> 00:02:14.350
Honestly, it's because he tried to spend
Christmas with just the two of you!

00:02:14.350 --> 00:02:15.020
It's just not fair.

00:02:15.020 --> 00:02:16.690
You're right...

00:02:16.690 --> 00:02:19.160
If only I hadn't left him alone there...

00:02:20.020 --> 00:02:22.560
If only I hadn't left his gift
behind in the first place...

00:02:22.560 --> 00:02:26.000
N-No! I'm not blaming you at all!

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:27.870
He's the one at fault!

00:02:28.330 --> 00:02:31.000
But it's already New Year's,

00:02:31.000 --> 00:02:33.020
and he still hasn't replied.

00:02:33.020 --> 00:02:35.370
Should I go see how he's doing?

00:02:35.370 --> 00:02:37.800
Maybe he ended up in the hospital?

00:02:37.800 --> 00:02:39.300
Nah, don't bother.

00:02:39.790 --> 00:02:43.760
Men don't want you to see them
when they're weak.

00:02:45.940 --> 00:02:47.050
You okay?

00:02:51.370 --> 00:02:53.640
Just leave me alone...

00:02:55.750 --> 00:02:58.770
That's what Maa-kun was like
when he had a hangover.

00:02:59.250 --> 00:03:00.520
I see.

00:03:00.520 --> 00:03:03.060
I never thought about that.

00:03:03.060 --> 00:03:04.870
Of course!

00:03:04.870 --> 00:03:07.530
Though I wouldn't know that about
men other than my brother...

00:03:07.530 --> 00:03:09.920
Then I'll wait until he replies.

00:03:09.920 --> 00:03:11.430
That's the way!

00:03:11.430 --> 00:03:13.740
Actually, don't even bother waiting!

00:03:14.960 --> 00:03:16.720
These oranges are yummy!

00:03:18.150 --> 00:03:21.330
Um... There was one more thing...

00:03:21.830 --> 00:03:23.170
He ki—

00:03:24.470 --> 00:03:26.800
We're all outta oranges!

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:30.130
That wasn't all.

00:03:30.130 --> 00:03:32.000
We got a whole lot of them.

00:03:32.000 --> 00:03:33.760
I'll go get more. Just wait.

00:03:35.500 --> 00:03:36.650
Sure!

00:03:47.040 --> 00:03:48.250
At that time...

00:03:52.660 --> 00:03:54.320
...he kissed me.

00:03:57.900 --> 00:04:01.880
What... should I say about it?

00:04:02.890 --> 00:04:06.510
Why would Hashiba-kun do that?

00:04:13.230 --> 00:04:15.090
My fever finally went down!

00:04:16.550 --> 00:04:19.990
You're not well yet.
You still have a cough.

00:04:19.990 --> 00:04:22.320
Stay in bed today and rest.

00:04:23.380 --> 00:04:25.280
Stay in bed!

00:04:26.520 --> 00:04:29.800
You were feverish a long time.
It could come back.

00:04:29.800 --> 00:04:31.490
Mom... I'm fine now.

00:04:32.150 --> 00:04:34.110
You're going to Grandpa's, right?

00:04:34.110 --> 00:04:36.650
Will you be okay by yourself?

00:04:36.650 --> 00:04:38.530
Your sisters are still in Hawaii.

00:04:38.530 --> 00:04:40.600
I said I'm fine!

00:04:40.600 --> 00:04:42.240
Mm-hm.

00:04:42.240 --> 00:04:45.800
Well, there'll be food downstairs.
Don't go outside.

00:04:47.800 --> 00:04:49.240
Okay.

00:04:52.650 --> 00:04:53.390
My Phone!

00:04:54.400 --> 00:04:56.600
Aah! It's out of juice!

00:04:59.770 --> 00:05:02.390
I've been in bed ever since Christmas.

00:05:02.390 --> 00:05:04.880
It's been five days... or six?

00:05:04.880 --> 00:05:06.900
That long already?

00:05:08.250 --> 00:05:11.580
How could I be such an idiot?

00:05:11.580 --> 00:05:13.830
Honestly, what am I doing?

00:05:14.160 --> 00:05:18.500
Sure, for the past few days
I thought I was gonna die...

00:05:20.030 --> 00:05:22.670
First I need to contact Kobayakawa-san.

00:05:26.430 --> 00:05:27.340
Hello?

00:05:27.680 --> 00:05:29.800
Hey, you finally picked up!

00:05:30.430 --> 00:05:31.720
How you holding up?

00:05:31.720 --> 00:05:33.030
Doing okay?

00:05:33.030 --> 00:05:34.720
I'm fine.

00:05:34.720 --> 00:05:36.320
Wait, how'd you know?

00:05:39.890 --> 00:05:41.600
"How"?

00:05:46.270 --> 00:05:48.440
What? Really?

00:05:48.440 --> 00:05:50.180
Really really!

00:05:50.180 --> 00:05:52.450
It was kinda shocking.

00:05:53.950 --> 00:05:56.080
As we were walking back from karaoke,

00:05:56.530 --> 00:05:58.750
we spotted you two by chance.

00:05:59.000 --> 00:06:00.460
Hashiba-kun!

00:06:02.140 --> 00:06:03.310
Oba-chan!

00:06:03.310 --> 00:06:04.580
It's Natsuki...!

00:06:04.980 --> 00:06:06.220
Oh, dear.

00:06:06.220 --> 00:06:08.630
What has my son been doing?

00:06:08.630 --> 00:06:11.130
We carried you home in a hurry.

00:06:11.920 --> 00:06:14.140
So that's what happened...

00:06:14.140 --> 00:06:16.720
Sorry to make trouble for you both.

00:06:16.720 --> 00:06:17.930
Nah, it's fine.

00:06:18.660 --> 00:06:20.240
You don't remember it?

00:06:20.240 --> 00:06:21.360
No.

00:06:21.360 --> 00:06:22.730
I don't remember.

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:23.730
Come to think of it...

00:06:24.210 --> 00:06:27.700
...that day, while I felt relieved
that Kobayakawa-san came back,

00:06:27.700 --> 00:06:29.950
I suddenly felt weak.

00:06:30.920 --> 00:06:33.510
My head went all fuzzy.

00:06:33.510 --> 00:06:34.540
Uh...

00:06:34.540 --> 00:06:36.080
After that...

00:06:36.080 --> 00:06:37.080
Huh?

00:06:37.540 --> 00:06:40.920
She gave me a pair of gloves, and then...

00:06:40.920 --> 00:06:42.000
And then...?

00:06:42.590 --> 00:06:44.110
What did I do?

00:06:44.110 --> 00:06:45.170
Hellooo!

00:06:45.870 --> 00:06:48.960
Oh right, I would've given her the present.

00:06:50.740 --> 00:06:51.510
It's...

00:06:51.870 --> 00:06:53.680
there!!

00:06:53.970 --> 00:06:56.940
That means I fainted before
I could give it to her!

00:06:56.940 --> 00:06:59.640
There went all my plans to confess!

00:07:00.190 --> 00:07:02.020
So hey, if you're over your cold.

00:07:02.540 --> 00:07:05.350
Want to join us for Hatsumoude tonight?

00:07:05.350 --> 00:07:06.980
We're going to Hokkaido Shrine.

00:07:07.460 --> 00:07:09.840
H-Hatsumoude?

00:07:09.840 --> 00:07:11.400
I'd like to go...

00:07:11.750 --> 00:07:15.230
...but I really should avoid crowds for now.

00:07:16.340 --> 00:07:18.920
Sorry. I'll pass.

00:07:18.920 --> 00:07:20.180
All right.

00:07:20.180 --> 00:07:21.080
Take care, then.

00:07:21.610 --> 00:07:23.590
Yeah. Thanks.

00:07:25.250 --> 00:07:26.200
Okay.

00:07:26.200 --> 00:07:28.150
Next will be Kobayakawa-san.

00:07:32.500 --> 00:07:34.740
Kobayakawa-san...

00:07:34.740 --> 00:07:35.630
Just...

00:07:36.780 --> 00:07:39.030
...just how much of an idiot am I?

00:07:43.700 --> 00:07:46.270
Oh, Hashiba-kun!

00:07:49.080 --> 00:07:51.690
Thank goodness.
It looks like he's doing alright.

00:07:55.530 --> 00:07:58.510
Hashiba-kun doesn't need to apologize...

00:07:59.950 --> 00:08:00.620
But...

00:08:01.620 --> 00:08:04.290
...he hasn't said anything about that.

00:08:06.510 --> 00:08:07.670
Huh?!

00:08:08.670 --> 00:08:12.220
I'm going with Anna for Hatsumoude!

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:13.110
"Where"?!

00:08:13.110 --> 00:08:14.090
Hokkaido Shrine!

00:08:14.430 --> 00:08:15.550
Crap, I told him!

00:08:15.550 --> 00:08:16.930
Don't you dare go too!

00:08:16.930 --> 00:08:20.260
And don't just call me
out of the blue! It's annoying!

00:08:20.260 --> 00:08:22.420
Was that Matsunaga-kun?

00:08:22.420 --> 00:08:23.430
Who was that on the phone?

00:08:24.030 --> 00:08:25.340
The creepy jerk.

00:08:25.340 --> 00:08:27.130
You're going for Hatsumoude together?

00:08:27.130 --> 00:08:28.650
Together with just you, yes.

00:08:29.190 --> 00:08:31.360
Agh! He's so irritating

00:08:31.900 --> 00:08:34.780
New Year's only comes once a year!

00:08:34.780 --> 00:08:38.280
Then, just maybe,
I'll see Hashiba-kun there.

00:08:38.880 --> 00:08:41.330
I could ask him then.

00:08:41.330 --> 00:08:42.740
<i>Yeah.</i>

00:08:44.280 --> 00:08:47.370
Keiichi-san! You're here?

00:08:48.140 --> 00:08:49.270
Yeah.

00:08:49.270 --> 00:08:50.500
But I'm going right back out.

00:08:50.840 --> 00:08:53.260
Oh, thank you for the present.

00:08:53.260 --> 00:08:54.410
I'll get you something in return.

00:08:54.410 --> 00:08:55.300
It's fine!

00:08:55.300 --> 00:08:57.800
I'm just glad you liked it!

00:08:59.410 --> 00:09:00.340
Onii-chan!

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:02.920
Why didn't you tell me?

00:09:03.970 --> 00:09:06.890
I didn't want to interrupt your studies.

00:09:06.890 --> 00:09:08.800
I'm taking a break today!

00:09:08.800 --> 00:09:10.470
It's New Year's, you know!

00:09:10.470 --> 00:09:11.310
Are you?

00:09:11.720 --> 00:09:13.060
Then, wanna join us for Hatsumoude?

00:09:14.150 --> 00:09:15.190
What?

00:09:15.190 --> 00:09:16.550
Can I?

00:09:16.550 --> 00:09:19.070
There's food stalls.
How about if I thank you for the gift there?

00:09:19.590 --> 00:09:20.820
Let's get something to eat.

00:09:21.180 --> 00:09:22.680
Come on, man!

00:09:22.680 --> 00:09:25.160
Well, Tsutsui-san might be there, too.

00:09:25.740 --> 00:09:27.260
It's better if we're all together.

00:09:28.850 --> 00:09:31.520
You're not going anyway, right, Nozomi?

00:09:31.520 --> 00:09:34.840
It's cold, and you wouldn't want to catch
a cold right before your entrance exams.

00:09:34.840 --> 00:09:38.010
No, I'll go! To pray that I pass!

00:09:38.340 --> 00:09:39.600
And...

00:09:39.600 --> 00:09:42.820
...for a successful romance.

00:09:52.110 --> 00:09:53.520
I'm ready to go!

00:09:55.830 --> 00:09:57.690
Come on, Mattsun, we're going!

00:10:17.960 --> 00:10:19.660
<i>Until the year ends...</i>

00:10:22.730 --> 00:10:23.380
<i>Five...</i>

00:10:30.680 --> 00:10:32.230
Kobayakawa-san...

00:10:33.490 --> 00:10:34.190
<i>Four...</i>

00:10:43.540 --> 00:10:44.320
<i>Three...</i>

00:10:51.750 --> 00:10:52.530
<i>Two...</i>

00:10:58.160 --> 00:10:59.130
<i>One...</i>

00:11:12.770 --> 00:11:13.790
Happy New Year!

00:11:13.790 --> 00:11:15.430
Yes, Happy New Year!

00:11:17.560 --> 00:11:20.610
Happy New Year, Anna!

00:11:21.290 --> 00:11:22.450
Happy New Year.
